What You Must Know to Understand Fade-In Code
️Important: Materials & URP Transparency
For your NaCl 3D object to actually fade with alpha:
Material must support transparency:
Built-in: use Standard shader → Rendering Mode = Transparent.
URP: use URP/Lit → Surface Type = Transparent.
Then your FadeIn/FadeOut code using mat.color.a will work.
If you fade but see no change → 99% chance material is still Opaque.

